'''Jessie Loftin Britt Jr.''' (born March 3, 1963) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] [[wide receiver]] who played one season with the [[Pittsburgh Steelers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[North Carolina A&T Aggies football|North Carolina A&T Aggies]]
